OL,3,GNEWSANot planning for a united Ireland
OL,4,Ais not 'sustainable', says tanaiste
OL,5,
OL,6,FTanaiste (Irish deputy prime minister)
OL,7,FSimon Harris has said not planning for
OL,8,Fa united Ireland is not a "sustainable
OL,9,Fpolicy".
OL,11,FHe was speaking at his party's ard
OL,12,Ffheis (party conference) in Cork, where
OL,13,Fthe Fine Gael "blueprint" on Irish
OL,14,Funity was published.
OL,16,F"The work needs to be done and not
OL,17,Fplanning isn't a sustainable policy,"
OL,18,Fhe told reporters.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
