OL,3,GNEWSANot planning for a united Ireland
OL,4,Ais not 'sustainable', says tanaiste
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the new Fine Gael policy lays
OL,7,Fout what the costs "might be" and said
OL,8,Fif the UK did not play "any role"
OL,9,Faround debt or pensions, it could cost
OL,10,Fthe Irish taxpayer up to bB,25bn
OL,11,F(#20.8bn).
